      "title": "Directed fault cover is not sampled even though all three procedural attacks are detected",
      "detail": "The directed testbench checks protocol_error directly after each of three attacks and reports protocol_attacks=3, while the integration SVA observes five global-fault cover matches and zero post-fault accepts. The directed cp_fault cover remains zero because the first two attacks are immediately followed by reset and the final test ends without another sampling edge. This is a coverage-observability debt, not evidence of a missed fault; a future harness may hold the final fault for one extra edge."
